# Swift 6

- Language mode: Swift 6. Strict concurrency.
- UI: SwiftUI unless an approved ADR says otherwise.
- No force-unwrap / `try!` on production paths without an ADR.
- Prefer actors and `Sendable` over GCD-first designs.
- Read `TRACK.md`. Do not add iPad layout work on an iPhone-only track (and vice versa) unless the spec changed.
